{
 "_readme": [
  "Station hubs: the stations listed here get upgraded pages (best frequency tonight by region, reception logs, videos, FAQ).",
  "Station names must match the schedule exactly. Order doesn't matter. Add or remove stations freely.",
  "intro: 1-3 sentences in YOUR words about hearing this station (shown at the top of the page). Leave empty if you haven't heard it.",
  "logs: your own catches, newest anywhere. Fields: date (YYYY-MM-DD), khz, sinpo, radio, antenna, location, note. Only date and khz are required.",
  "videos: YouTube clips of this station. Fields: id (the part after youtu.be/ or shorts/), title, date (YYYY-MM-DD upload date).",
  "Community catches from data/reception.json are added automatically when their 'station' field matches.",
  "Example log: {\"date\":\"2026-09-20\",\"khz\":6000,\"sinpo\":\"34333\",\"radio\":\"Tecsun PL-330\",\"antenna\":\"whip\",\"location\":\"San Tan Valley, AZ\",\"note\":\"English news, fading in and out\"}",
  "Example video: {\"id\":\"9WNWMAypFpk\",\"title\":\"Radio Habana Cuba on 6000 kHz\",\"date\":\"2026-09-20\"}"
 ],
